    "review": "The fixed multiplication routine reaches its mapped halt label21 while still running, before executing that label. For every valid caller embedding and every legal trace at any offset, actual output memory is the actual matrix product, outside-output cells and caller registers outside the injected real/natural frames are preserved, and actual CostThrough is bounded by the caller prefix plus the proved cubic component cost. Continuation code at the mapped exit is unconstrained.",
